From 31176ecb7dad4ea9adadeaefa2233bc5488d7350 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:28:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/78] Port training (H013+$58DC) and the level-dependent
 values

Port Train Character H013+$58DC (trampoline $051C), used by the main
menu and, without prompts, by Create New Character to level up the
classes the starting experience allows. Also port H073+$0012 (spell
slots for every class) and $05AE (level-dependent values), H063+$3F72
(experience table row), H029+$039A (or_byte) and H030+$0AD2/$0B4A
(timed message).

The interactive spell choice H065+$34FC stays a stub; creation now
reaches the reroll question and the character name, then stops at
H028+$0D36.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
